digraph F {
  graph [bgcolor="#0f1116", rankdir=TB, fontname="DejaVu Sans Mono", fontcolor="#d8dde6", labelloc=t, labeljust=l, nodesep=0.3, ranksep=0.35, pad=0.4,
         label="DOOMSAT . ONE DECISION END TO END (graph v1, jev-1.13.0, 22 Sep 2026)\l"];
  node [shape=box, style="rounded,filled", fillcolor="#161a22", fontname="DejaVu Sans Mono", fontsize=11, fontcolor="#d8dde6", penwidth=1.4, margin="0.2,0.12"];
  edge [color="#8b93a1", fontname="DejaVu Sans Mono", fontsize=10, fontcolor="#8b93a1", penwidth=1.2];
  b0 [label="Payload telemetry through F Prime, CCSDS and Yamcs -- tic\l3244, 92.7 s into the level\lhealth 33, armor 0, shotgun loaded; one Zombieman in view at\lmid-range\leight candidate places, each with a world position, a path\ldistance, how much unseen ground lies behind it, how wide the\lway on is and what is standing near it\lone of them is the level exit: the automap drew that line 166\lunits away, the first time this attempt has seen it\lthe position and the distances are for CODE to aim and plan\lwith; none of them reach the model\l", color="#4a5160"];
  b1 [label="State document (code, no model)\lhere: mode explore, health critical, armor none, ammunition\lready, keys none, stuck no\lneeds: health urgent, ammo none, armor wanted\lcombat: a straggler, Zombieman, one, mid-range\lt0 -- what the level exit, how_far close, relative_distance\lnearer than most, direction behind-left,\lunseen_ground_behind_it none, tried_before no, threat none\lt3 -- what unexplored edge, the_way_on_is a doorway,\lunknown_runs a fair way, gate none, further_from_the_start\labout as far out, threat none\l", color="#4a5160"];
  b2 [label="jev-1.13.0, one request, 354 ms, 5,232 input tokens\l(req_01a0cdc29a2674a9abccb11b0b42b85d)\ltarget  t0 7.02 (the exit, confidence 0.56)  t3 5.60  t1 5.49\lt2 5.34  t7 4.89  t5 4.64  t6 3.74  t4 1.03\lengage  Retreat (confidence 0.82)\lweapon  Shotgun (confidence 0.81)\lthe need head is asked every goal_every decisions, and was not\lasked on this one\l", color="#d9a441"];
  b3 [label="Code rules\ltop two 7.02 against 5.60: a gap of 1.42 rubric levels, well\lclear of unsure_gap, so jev's ranking stands and the exit is\lthe target\lcommitment: the margin to beat is 1.2 levels and nothing beats\lthe exit, so it is committed to\lengage Retreat -> mode RETREAT, stance retreat: back away from\lthe Zombieman while going for it\luse_at_target is set, because the thing being walked to is\lsomething you open\l", color="#3fae6a"];
  b4 [label="INTENT(mode=RETREAT, target=2928,-4720, stance=retreat,\lfire=any attacker, use_at_target, ttl=1500ms)\lYamcs HTTP -> CCSDS TC -> UDP -> F Prime CmdDispatcher -> Doom\lcomponent -> the onboard executor\ltelemetry was 83 ms old, jev took 354 ms, the command took 44\lms: 481 ms from observation to effect, against a 900 ms budget\lthe executor carries this out at 35 Hz for up to 1.5 s without\lasking anything -- the player does not stand still waiting for\lthe next answer\l12.3 seconds later the level ended\l", color="#4f8fd6"];
  b0 -> b1 [label=" telemetry -> words: bands, comparisons and categories, one vocabulary. No coordinate, no number"];
  b1 -> b2 [label=" HTTPS POST /v1/systemone: one call, eight target questions plus engage plus weapon"];
